{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "53789c4a-a3ae-8909-94ec-dc7458be988d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T11:47:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, um, I think I'm calling the right place? It's about a crosswalk. The paint on it, I think, has sort of faded almost completely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are in the right place. Faded crosswalk paint, okay. Can you tell me where the crosswalk is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, I think it's right at 60 Dixon Street. In the North End. Maybe right in front of that, or sort of just past it, [line breaks up] hard to say exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me a little there. Did you say 60 Dixon Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 60 Dixon Street. Sorry, I'm on my cell and the signal in here is maybe not great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I've got it now. 60 Dixon Street, North End. And what's happening there, the lines are worn off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I think they're mostly gone. You can sort of see a ghost of them if you look. And the cars, I think, mostly don't stop. People crossing, maybe, have to wait and then just kind of go and hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the paint's faded and drivers aren't stopping for people in the crosswalk. Let me get that down. Is there a sign there too, or just the paint?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think there's a sign, maybe, on one side? It's sort of leaning. But I'm not totally sure about that. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll note that there may be a sign on one side. Are you the one who crosses there, or have you seen other people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, I think. I cross it, and I've seen other people, [inaudible] a lot of people walking. I have some photos, actually, if that helps. I took them on my phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. I can give you an email address to send them to, or if you'd rather, you can bring them up to the office. Which is easier for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, maybe I can just send them. Could you say that again? Sorry, there's a little noise on my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Actually, let me take your number first so someone can follow up, and they can tell you how to send the photos. What's a good callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Reading that back: 401-555-0195. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Sorry, that clicking sound, that's me, I think. I'm knitting while I wait, the needles are sort of loud on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I can barely hear it. You're fine. Let me read it all back so I've got it right. Crosswalk at 60 Dixon Street, paint faded, vehicles not stopping, photos available, callback number you gave me. Name is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cristina Moniz. M-O-N-I-Z, I think that's how it's spelled on, um, yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cristina Moniz, M-O-N-I-Z. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I ask, maybe, how long repairs like this usually take? Like, I think, repainting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:47:06-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the crew's schedule. This time of year it's cold, and paint doesn't go down well in low temperatures, so the lines often wait for warmer weather. But the request gets logged now, and someone can check the spot and see if anything can be done sooner, like the sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:47:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. So maybe weeks, or maybe longer, sort of until spring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be into spring for the repainting itself, yes. The inspection of the location would come sooner than that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think that makes sense. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:47:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Cristina. Someone will be in touch about the photos. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
